# Lt. Arex, Ever-Adapting: "You may put up to three land cards from your hand onto the battlefield tapped" - the "up to
# three" is a limit the question enforces (CR 608.2d): when four land cards are in hand, a choice of four is not a choice
# the question takes, so it is refused here. The positive control is the sibling scenario that chooses exactly three.

